---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy | Jaipur Balloon Decoration" description="Privacy policy for Balloon Decor Jaipur. Learn how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.">
	<main class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-12 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
		<h1 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-[#1f2a44]">Privacy Policy</h1>
		<p class="mt-2 text-sm text-[#6b7a99]">Last updated: June 2025</p>

		<div class="mt-8 space-y-8 text-base leading-relaxed text-[#4f5e7c]">
			<section>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1f2a44]">1. Information We Collect</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">When you interact with balloondecorjaipur.com, we may collect the following information:</p>
				<ul class="mt-3 list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
					<li>Name and contact number (when you WhatsApp or call us for a booking)</li>
					<li>Event details such as date, venue, and decoration type</li>
					<li>General usage data collected via analytics tools (Vercel Analytics)</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1f2a44]">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">We use the information collected to:</p>
				<ul class="mt-3 list-disc pl-6 space-y-2">
					<li>Confirm and coordinate your decoration booking</li>
					<li>Send booking confirmations and reminders</li>
					<li>Improve our website and services based on usage data</li>
					<li>Respond to your queries and feedback</li>
				</ul>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1f2a44]">3. Data Sharing</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">We do not sell, trade, or share your personal information with third parties for marketing purposes. Your information may be shared only with our decoration team members as required to fulfil your booking.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1f2a44]">4. Data Retention</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">We retain your booking information for up to 12 months after your event for record-keeping and service improvement purposes. After this period, your data is deleted.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1f2a44]">5. Cookies &amp; Analytics</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">Our website uses Vercel Analytics to collect anonymised usage statistics. No personally identifiable information is collected via analytics. You can opt out of analytics tracking by using a browser extension that blocks analytics scripts.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1f2a44]">6. Your Rights</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">You have the right to request access to, correction of, or deletion of your personal data held by us. To make such a request, contact us at <a href="mailto:info@balloondecorjaipur.com" class="text-[#6b3fe7] underline">info@balloondecorjaipur.com</a>.</p>
			</section>

			<section>
				<h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-[#1f2a44]">7. Contact</h2>
				<p class="mt-2">For any privacy-related questions, contact us at <a href="mailto:info@balloondecorjaipur.com" class="text-[#6b3fe7] underline">info@balloondecorjaipur.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+918690924378" class="text-[#6b3fe7] underline">+91 86909 24378</a>.</p>
			</section>
		</div>

		<div class="mt-10">
			<a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-full bg-[#6b3fe7] px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-semibold text-white">
				← Back to Home
			</a>
		</div>
	</main>
</Layout>

